  "reason": "Integer sums preserve exact values: 2^53 + 1 is 9007199254740993, 10 + 1 is 11, and 1 + 1 is 2. The empty history sums to integer 0. Float64 cannot distinguish 2^53 + 1 from 2^53, so the corresponding floating sum is 9007199254740992.0. Two float64 values of 1e308 overflow to positive infinity, represented with an explicit JSON tag; the empty floating sum is 0.0. Summing grouped int64 counts yields the exact total row count, including zero for an empty history.",
